      "text": "I heard thy voice … and I was afraid, Gen. 3:10. Moses hid his face; for he was afraid to look, Ex. 3:6. be not afraid, neither … dismayed, Josh. 1:9. of whom shall I be afraid, Ps. 27:1. What time I am afraid, I will trust in thee, Ps. 56:3. I will not be afraid what man can do unto me, Ps. 56:11. I will trust, and not be afraid: for the Lord, Isa. 12:2. lift up thy voice … be not afraid, Isa. 40:9. shouldest be afraid of a man that shall die, Isa. 51:12. Be not afraid of their faces: for I am with thee, Jer. 1:8.",
